      <div class="loc-prose">
        <h2>Plumbing and heating in Blyth</h2>
        <p>Blyth is a small Huron County community east of Goderich, set in the farm country the county is known for. We cover the Blyth area from our Goderich shop on request, and the work there is the honest, essential kind: rural residential plumbing and heating, water heaters, drain and sewer service, and furnace and boiler work for the homes and farm-adjacent properties in the area.</p>
        <p>Rural properties around Blyth often have their own quirks, older wells and septic, long water line runs, and outbuildings that need their own plumbing and heat. We have the drain-cleaning and camera equipment to find underground problems and the licensed crew to handle the repair or replacement, with permits and inspection handled on the work that requires it.</p>
        <p>Because Blyth is close to our Goderich shop, routine calls are easy to schedule, and the 24-hour emergency line covers no-heat and plumbing emergencies there day or night.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</LocationLayout>
